o find way forward on filling mayor's seat","source":"https://boisedev.com/news/2026/04/22/nampa-expands-people-under-consideration-for-mayor-appointment/?emci=57262c37-923e-f111-8ef2-000d3a14b640&emdi=d9ce9dfd-0b3f-f111-8ef2-000d3a14b640&ceid=110103","author":["[[Erin Banks Rusby - BoiseDev Reporter]]"],"published":"2026-04-22","created":"2026-07-08","description":"The Nampa City Council continues to grapple with which person to appoint as its next mayor, including whether to consider two potential appointees the council already voted against. The council held a special meeting on Monday to discuss next steps in the selection process put in motion by the death of Nampa Mayor Rick Hogaboam […]"},"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[]},